WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.657
"It’s a good day for painting," said Mom.

2
00:00:12.658 --> 00:00:20.339
"The kitchen needs some fresh paint."

3
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.470
Mom got some paint from the basement.

4
00:00:24.471 --> 00:00:29.260
She found a paint roller and a tray.

5
00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:37.244
She put a plastic sheet on the floor.

6
00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:42.374
Then she started painting the kitchen.

7
00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:51.909
Harry and Oliver ran in with a football.

8
00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:55.947
"Don't throw that in here," warned Mom.

9
00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:58.335
But the boys didn't listen.

10
00:00:58.336 --> 00:01:02.046
"Catch, Oliver!" yelled Harry.

11
00:01:02.047 --> 00:01:04.110
The football hit the wall.

12
00:01:04.111 --> 00:01:08.969
Splat! Paint went everywhere.

13
00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:20.416
"Oh no!" cried Mom.

14
00:01:20.417 --> 00:01:24.497
Mom cleaned up the paint.

15
00:01:24.498 --> 00:01:31.063
Then she started painting again.

16
00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:35.215
Aunt Judy came home from shopping.

17
00:01:35.216 --> 00:01:38.160
"Watch out!" called Mom.

18
00:01:38.161 --> 00:01:41.296
But it was too late.

19
00:01:41.297 --> 00:01:47.052
Aunt Judy bumped into the wet paint!

20
00:01:47.053 --> 00:01:56.860
"My new sweater!" said Aunt Judy.

21
00:01:56.861 --> 00:02:00.703
Mom started painting again.

22
00:02:00.704 --> 00:02:08.624
Emmy and Rover came into the kitchen.

23
00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:12.052
"Sit, Rover!" said Emmy.

24
00:02:12.053 --> 00:02:15.200
But Rover didn’t sit.

25
00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:19.384
Rover barked and ran toward Mom.

26
00:02:19.385 --> 00:02:22.395
"No, Rover!" yelled Mom.

27
00:02:22.396 --> 00:02:24.996
Rover bumped into the paint tray.

28
00:02:24.997 --> 00:02:28.438
Paint spilled all over the sheet.

29
00:02:28.439 --> 00:02:35.460
Mom sat down and sighed.

30
00:02:35.461 --> 00:02:38.692
Then she washed the paint roller.

31
00:02:38.693 --> 00:02:42.369
She put the lid on the paint can.

32
00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:48.084
Mom put everything back in the basement.

33
00:02:48.085 --> 00:02:56.288
"It’s not a good day for painting," said Mom.

34
00:02:56.289 --> 00:03:11.034
"It’s a good day for resting!"

